179
00:07:13,461 --> 00:07:14,021
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah, Stanley.

180
00:07:19,988 --> 00:07:20,969
[SPEAKER_00]: He's still going strong.

181
00:07:20,989 --> 00:07:22,470
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, we interviewed him out in South Bend.

182
00:07:22,490 --> 00:07:22,730
[SPEAKER_00]: Really?

183
00:07:22,770 --> 00:07:23,030
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah.

184
00:07:23,310 --> 00:07:25,231
[SPEAKER_01]: Where do you live in Manuka?

185
00:07:25,291 --> 00:07:25,852
[SPEAKER_01]: South Bend.

186
00:07:26,312 --> 00:07:27,032
[SPEAKER_01]: South Bend, huh?

187
00:07:27,072 --> 00:07:28,393
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, Indiana, yeah.

188
00:07:28,433 --> 00:07:29,994
[SPEAKER_01]: Used to live in Pecorino.

189
00:07:30,014 --> 00:07:30,334
[SPEAKER_01]: Shemokin.

190
00:07:30,635 --> 00:07:31,375
[SPEAKER_01]: Shemokin, yeah.

191
00:07:31,835 --> 00:07:32,356
