197
00:07:41,141 --> 00:07:41,301
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah.

198
00:07:41,341 --> 00:07:45,044
[SPEAKER_02]: It was the week before I went up to the Hall of Fame.

199
00:07:45,524 --> 00:07:46,505
[SPEAKER_02]: What happened to Luke?

200
00:07:47,205 --> 00:07:47,905
