201
00:07:47,925 --> 00:07:48,806
[SPEAKER_02]: He's in Akron, Ohio.

202
00:07:49,425 --> 00:07:52,388
[SPEAKER_02]: I spent a morning with him a few years ago.

203
00:07:53,008 --> 00:07:55,590
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah, he's a...

204
00:07:55,610 --> 00:07:57,612
[SPEAKER_02]: He's a very nice guy.

205
00:07:58,592 --> 00:07:59,813
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, a very nice boy.

206
00:08:01,935 --> 00:08:03,436
[SPEAKER_01]: And a little boss Stevenson.

207
00:08:04,036 --> 00:08:05,798
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah, we talked to him in Tuscaloosa.

208
00:08:06,138 --> 00:08:06,879
