209
00:08:06,899 --> 00:08:07,119
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

210
00:08:07,939 --> 00:08:08,740
[SPEAKER_02]: Neighbor Joey Seals.

211
00:08:08,760 --> 00:08:09,701
[SPEAKER_01]: That's what he was.

212
00:08:09,741 --> 00:08:11,382
[SPEAKER_02]: He played football.

213
00:08:11,402 --> 00:08:14,885
[SPEAKER_02]: Did you play football sometimes?

214
00:08:14,905 --> 00:08:15,165
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

215
00:08:18,338 --> 00:08:23,804
[SPEAKER_02]: Riggins, Stevenson, and Joey Shore, that was convenient there, right?

216
00:08:25,765 --> 00:08:29,489
